:: FlashbackEnter [nobr noreturn] {"position":"900,900","size":"100,100"}
/* Transition passage: the Flashbacks gallery stamps $flashbacks.active
   via the link click handler, then SugarCube routes here. We forward
   to the scene's source passage so the replay starts. The catalogued
   scene is whitelisted by the Flashbacks replay-containment handler
   so the redirect doesn't bounce us straight back. */
<<set _flashbackEntry = setup.Flashbacks.activeEntry()>>
<<if _flashbackEntry>>
	<<goto _flashbackEntry.scenePassage>>
<<else>>
	<<goto "Flashbacks">>
<</if>>
